</td><td align="left" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>Note: SSS: sum stress score; MPS: myocardial perfusion scintigraphy.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>